## Agenda

1. Review of Previous Quarter
2. Product Usage and Adoption
3. Success Metrics and ROI
4. Roadmap and Upcoming Features
5. Open Discussion and Q&A

## Review of Previous Quarter

- What went well?
- What challenges did you face?
- How can we better support you?

## Product Usage and Adoption

- Current usage statistics
- Feature adoption rates
- User feedback

## Success Metrics and ROI

- Review of key performance indicators (KPIs)
- Demonstrated ROI and business value
- Comparison to baseline

## Roadmap and Upcoming Features

- Preview of upcoming product releases
- How new features will benefit the customer
- Opportunity for customer input on roadmap

## Action Items

- [ ] Follow up on open issues
- [ ] Schedule next QBR
- [ ] Share meeting notes and action items
